{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14361","headline":"登越王楼见乔公诗偶题 · 王铤","name":"登越王楼见乔公诗偶题","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云架重楼出郡城，虹梁雅韵仲宣情。\n越王空置千年迹，丞相兼扬万古名。\n过鸟时时冲客会，闲风往往弄江声。\n谬将蹇步寻高躅，鱼目骊珠岂继明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王铤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14361.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14361","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}